## Summary

Adds a `.mcp.json` at the repo root to register the `productivity-suite` MCP server, complementing the `make claude` workflow documented in `CLAUDE.md`.

### Tools provided

- **`format_text`** — formats text according to style guidelines
- **`summarize`** — generates concise summaries

Streamable HTTP transport — no binary, no npm. Works immediately after `make claude`:

```json
{
  "mcpServers": {
    "productivity-suite": {
      "type": "http",
      "url": "https://productivity-suite-mcp.onrender.com/mcp"
    }
  }
}
```

Source: [zellkernel/productivity-suite-mcp](https://github.com/zellkernel/productivity-suite-mcp)
